  "levels": [
    {
      "id": "l1",
      "kind": "lesson",
      "title": "Volatility",
      "pages": [
        {
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "Volatility"
            },
            {
              "type": "image",
              "image": "obrazki/1-zmiennosc.png",
              "width": 1,
              "maxHeight": 240,
              "caption": ""
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Volatility** tells you how strongly and how fast the price jumps up and down. Over a short horizon, it decides the result."
            },
            {
              "type": "list",
              "items": [
                "**High** – cryptocurrencies, small companies",
                "**Low** – global ETFs, bonds"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "callout",
              "text": "High volatility is a chance for a **quick gain**, but also for a **quick loss**."
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "minigame": {
        "game": "",
        "settings": []
      },
      "tasks": []
    },
    {
      "id": "l2",
      "kind": "lesson",
      "title": "Financial leverage",
      "pages": [
        {
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "Financial leverage"
            },
            {
              "type": "image",
              "image": "obrazki/2-dzwignia-finansowa.png",
              "width": 1,
              "maxHeight": 240,
              "caption": ""
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Leverage** lets you trade with more money than you have. With **1:10** leverage, 100 € controls a position worth 1,000 €."
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "It multiplies gains, but **it multiplies losses too**: a 10% price drop can wipe out your whole deposit."
            },
            {
              "type": "callout",
              "text": "In the EU, leverage for retail clients is limited, but it's still a tool for experienced traders – **not for beginners**."
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "minigame": {
        "game": "",
        "settings": []
      },
      "tasks": []
    },
    {
      "id": "l3",
      "kind": "lesson",
      "title": "Stop-Loss",
      "pages": [
        {
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "Stop-Loss"
            },
            {
              "type": "image",
              "image": "obrazki/3-stop-loss.png",
              "width": 1,
              "maxHeight": 240,
              "caption": ""
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "A **Stop-Loss** is an order that sells your position automatically when the price falls to a set level."
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Example: you buy at **100 €** and set the stop at **95 €** – the maximum loss is 5%. A small loss won't turn into a big one because “it might bounce back”."
            },
            {
              "type": "callout",
              "text": "In sharp moves it can be executed at a **worse price** than the one you set."
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "minigame": {
        "game": "",
        "settings": []
      },
      "tasks": []
    },
    {
      "id": "l4",
      "kind": "lesson",
      "title": "Take-Profit",
      "pages": [
        {
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "Take-Profit"
            },
            {
              "type": "image",
              "image": "obrazki/4-take-profit.png",
              "width": 1,
              "maxHeight": 240,
              "caption": ""
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "A **Take-Profit** is an order that sells your position automatically when the price reaches your target."
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Example: you buy at **100 €** and set the target at **110 €** – the profit is taken automatically, even when you're not watching the screen."
            },
            {
              "type": "callout",
              "text": "It helps you stick to the plan instead of greedily waiting for “**just a bit more**”."
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "minigame": {
        "game": "",
        "settings": []
      },
      "tasks": []
    },
